  "title": "TikTok Green Goddess Salad",
  "description": "This bowl from the viral TikTok video from Baked by Melissa is just as delicious and scoop-able as it is in her video. The dressing is so tasty that we recommend mixing up an extra batch to use on grilled veggies, fish and even as a sauce for pizza!",
